When an Extension merely supports optional compatibility, an accurate
statement such as "Compatible with bBpiano (bbpl)" may be used alongside
the copyright notice instead. Notices must be accurate and must not imply
that the Licensor sponsors, endorses, or certifies a third-party product.

No attribution is required for Output under Section 5. Academic research
should follow applicable scholarly citation conventions, but this license
does not prescribe a special citation format for research publications.

